{"loc":"ALUSI-FULL:v24p75#2","rows":[{"verses":["40:49"],"words":["ٱلَّذِينَ فِى ٱلنَّارِ"],"type":"referent","speaker":"author","stance":"holds","claim":"Both the weak and the arrogant inhabitants of the Fire make this request when their arguments fail and their options narrow.","anchor":"من الضعفاء والمستكبرين جميعا لما ضاقت بهم الحيل وعيت بهم العلل","mentions":[]},{"verses":["40:49"],"words":["لِخَزَنَةِ جَهَنَّمَ"],"type":"rhetoric","speaker":"author","stance":"reports","claim":"Naming the keepers of Jahannam rather than the keepers of the Fire intensifies the threat, since Jahannam is more specific and may denote the deepest pit.","anchor":"وكان الظاهر لخزنتها بضمير النار لكن وضع الظاهر موضعه للتهويل فإن جهنم أخص من النار","mentions":[]},{"verses":["40:49"],"words":["خَزَنَةِ جَهَنَّمَ"],"type":"interpretation","speaker":"author","stance":"reports","claim":"Another explanation places these disbelievers in Jahannam, the deepest level, and supposes its angels most likely to answer because of their greater nearness to God.","anchor":"أو لأنها محل لأشد العذاب الشامل للنار وغيرها وجوز أن يكون ذلك لبيان محل الكفرة في النار بأن تكون جهنم أبعد دركاتها","mentions":[]},{"verses":["40:49"],"words":["خَزَنَةِ جَهَنَّمَ"],"type":"interpretation","speaker":"author","stance":"reports","claim":"A further explanation is that those angels are assigned to the worst inmates and are presumed more responsive because of their closeness to God.","anchor":"فلعل الملائكة الموكلين بعذاب أولئك أجوب دعوة لزيادة قربهم من الله عز وجل","mentions":[]},{"verses":["40:49"],"words":["يُخَفِّفْ عَنَّا يَوْمًۭا"],"type":"meaning","speaker":"author","stance":"holds","claim":"They ask that one day’s measure, reckoned by worldly days, be removed from the punishment.","anchor":"أي مقدار يوم من أيام الدنيا","mentions":[]},{"verses":["40:49"],"words":["مِّنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ"],"type":"grammar","speaker":"author","stance":"reports","claim":"Min can be explanatory or partitive; one parse omits the object of lighten and treats min al-ʿadhāb as its clarification.","anchor":"فمفعول ( يخفف ) محذوف و ( من ) تمل البيان والتبعيض","mentions":[]},{"verses":["40:49"],"words":["يَوْمًۭا مِّنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ"],"type":"grammar","speaker":"author","stance":"reports","claim":"Alternatively, day is the object with an omitted noun such as torment of a day, and from the punishment explains it: they ask to be spared one day of punishment.","anchor":"ويجوز أن يكون المفعول ( يوما ) بحذف المضاف نحو ألم يوم و ( من العذاب ) بيانه","mentions":[]}],"none":""}
